        "prompt": "define",
        "text": "=Generate six versions of storyboard-style draft image prompts for the following advertisement campaign concept:\n\n{{ $json['preferred_campaign_details'] }}\n\n** Guidelines for the prompts:\n\n- Begin each prompt with “Photo of a.”\n\n- Write the prompts in English.\n\n- Take this list as an example format for reference:\n\nExample 1. Photo of a joyful family, with two young children, playing on a tropical beach, with palm trees swaying in the background. The sky is clear, and the family is building sandcastles together.\n\nExample 2. Storyboard draft of a family enjoying a meal by the poolside, with the colorful resort backdrop. The sun is setting, and the atmosphere is warm and vibrant.\n\n- Use Temperature 0.9 for creative variations.\n\n- The output is a correct formed JSON array that contains the generated elements, in this form:\n\n[ \n  <Element Generated 1>,<Element Generated 2>, .. , <Element Generated N>\n]\n\nEach one of these elements must replicate this structure\n\n{\n      \"description\": \"Storyboard draft of a family enjoying a meal by the poolside, with the colorful resort backdrop. The sun is setting, and the atmosphere is warm and vibrant.\"\n}\n\nPlease, omit any introductory comment previously to the answer, go directly to the output, and remove from response json tag.\n\n",
        "options": {}
      },
